        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can use the standard algorithm to add multiple multi-digit whole numbers. </p>",
            "readable_text": "We can use the standard algorithm to add multiple multi-digit whole numbers.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For example, let&#x27;s use the standard algorithm to compute the following sum:</p>",
            "readable_text": "For example, let's use the standard algorithm to compute the following sum:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 801 + 523 + 198]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 801 + 523 + 198]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we line up our numbers:</p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we line up our numbers:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8|0|1; +|5|2|3; +|1|9|8]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 8|0|1; +|5|2|3; +|1|9|8]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Next, we add the numbers in each place value (from right to left). However, this time, we need to sum three numbers in each place value, as well as any carried digits:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Next, we add the numbers in each place value (from right to left). However, this time, we need to sum three numbers in each place value, as well as any carried digits:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 1|1|1; 8|0|1; +|5|2|3; +|1|9|8; 1|5|2|2]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 1|1|1; 8|0|1; +|5|2|3; +|1|9|8; 1|5|2|2]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Therefore, <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 801 + 523 + 198 = 1,522.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Therefore, [MATH: 801 + 523 + 198 = 1,522.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nWe can use the standard algorithm to add multiple multi-digit whole numbers.\n\nContent:\nFor example, let's use the standard algorithm to compute the following sum:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 801 + 523 + 198]\n\nContent:\nFirst, we line up our numbers:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 8|0|1; +|5|2|3; +|1|9|8]\n\nContent:\nNext, we add the numbers in each place value (from right to left). However, this time, we need to sum three numbers in each place value, as well as any carried digits:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 1|1|1; 8|0|1; +|5|2|3; +|1|9|8; 1|5|2|2]\n\nContent:\nTherefore, [MATH: 801 + 523 + 198 = 1,522.]"
      },
