        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Lauren is listening to some songs while waiting for a train. The duration of the first song is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 123]</span> seconds, the second is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 182]</span> seconds, and the third is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 157]</span> seconds. What is the total duration of all three songs?</p>",
            "readable_text": "Lauren is listening to some songs while waiting for a train. The duration of the first song is [MATH: 123] seconds, the second is [MATH: 182] seconds, and the third is [MATH: 157] seconds. What is the total duration of all three songs?",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To find the total duration of all three tracks, we need to compute the sum</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 123 + 182 + 157.]</span></p><p>First, we line up our numbers:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 1|2|3; +|1|8|2; +|1|5|7]</span></p><p>Next, we proceed by adding the numbers using the standard algorithm:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 1|1; 1|2|3; +|1|8|2; +|1|5|7; 4|6|2]</span></p><p>So, we have</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 123 + 182 + 157 = 462.]</span></p><p>Therefore, the total duration of all three songs is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 462]</span> seconds. </p>",
            "readable_text": "To find the total duration of all three tracks, we need to compute the sum\n\n[MATH: 123 + 182 + 157.]\n\nFirst, we line up our numbers:\n\n[MATH: 1|2|3; +|1|8|2; +|1|5|7]\n\nNext, we proceed by adding the numbers using the standard algorithm:\n[MATH: 1|1; 1|2|3; +|1|8|2; +|1|5|7; 4|6|2]\n\nSo, we have\n\n[MATH: 123 + 182 + 157 = 462.]\n\nTherefore, the total duration of all three songs is [MATH: 462] seconds.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nLauren is listening to some songs while waiting for a train. The duration of the first song is [MATH: 123] seconds, the second is [MATH: 182] seconds, and the third is [MATH: 157] seconds. What is the total duration of all three songs?\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo find the total duration of all three tracks, we need to compute the sum\n\n[MATH: 123 + 182 + 157.]\n\nFirst, we line up our numbers:\n\n[MATH: 1|2|3; +|1|8|2; +|1|5|7]\n\nNext, we proceed by adding the numbers using the standard algorithm:\n[MATH: 1|1; 1|2|3; +|1|8|2; +|1|5|7; 4|6|2]\n\nSo, we have\n\n[MATH: 123 + 182 + 157 = 462.]\n\nTherefore, the total duration of all three songs is [MATH: 462] seconds."
      },
